</ul>
</section>
<section class="takeaway">
<h2>Train the Reason, Not Just the Rule</h2>
<p>Servers who understand why a rule exists apply it correctly even in situations the training manual never covered — a tight table, a left-handed guest, a packed dining room. Teach the logic behind left and right service, and the correct side becomes instinct rather than a memorized chart.</p>
</section>
